            "notes": "IMPORTANT = YOU NEED IT\n\nThe goal here is to not be really a nuisance or even noticed by the enemy team until about round 3. Do what you need to do to secure about 1-2 rounds for your team if possible, but you do not want to be focused whatsoever until about round 3.\n\n[Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) and [Silent as the Grave](item_a2787a6d-3bf5-4d08-b5a5-704aaa053e42) are going to be relatively interchangable depending on how aggressive you'll have to be on their tank. If you want to ensure the pressure is kept on their tank, take [Revolving Ruin](item_244760fb-c91f-4a03-a45b-848745835b51) first.",
